zabbix-widget-event-timeline (0.1.4) unstable; urgency=high

  * URGENT FIX: the 0.1.3 RPM/DEB packages omitted three newer includes/
    class files (CWidgetFieldSelectAlwaysSaved.php, CWidgetFieldWeekStartView.php,
    DetailSelector.php) from the packaging file lists, causing a PHP Fatal
    error on every dashboard view/edit containing this widget. No functional
    code was changed; this release only corrects the packaged file list.

 -- claude <noreply@example.com>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

zabbix-widget-event-timeline (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added a Drilldown dialog that shows the detailed event list when clicking
    an event bar / stack segment (prototype-group or individual-event level,
    with a host name list).
  * The 7-day bucket's week-start day can now be configured per widget for
    all 7 weekdays (new widgets default to Sunday; existing widgets keep
    Monday).
  * Improved the 30-day-range X-axis date labels to use an evenly spaced
    grid.
  * Adjusted X-axis label overflow, bottom margin, and runtime control row
    wrapping.
  * Fixed the event bar tooltip no longer responding after changing the
    dashboard's displayed time period.
  * Clarified the paging item-count labels (chart body vs. Drilldown) and
    merged the "Detail view" setting into the "Paging" section.
  * Confirmed the automatic bucket-width candidates (1 minute to 1 month)
    intentionally omit a 2-day width; the granularity now jumps from 1 day
    directly to 7 days by design.

 -- claude <noreply@example.com>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

zabbix-widget-event-timeline (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Display modes (Timeline / Host / Host group / Event), sort order, paging
    and auto paging.
  * Source is now specified by host, host group and trigger fields, each fixed
    or taken from a widget.
  * New "X-axis labels" setting (Auto / Horizontal / Angled / Vertical); long
    names are truncated with full text on hover and in the tooltip.
  * Fixed untranslated strings in the Japanese UI.

 -- claude <noreply@example.com>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

zabbix-widget-event-timeline (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Monitoring target and events can be taken from fixed settings or from
    widgets (Tree Navigator / Event Navigator).
  * Events are specified by selecting triggers; with no trigger selected, all
    events of the target hosts are shown.
  * Runtime controls: severity chips, acknowledgement filter, aggregation
    (occurred / continuing), tooltip order, and reset.
  * Total / interval moved below the chart; settings dialog reorganized.

 -- claude <noreply@example.com>  Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

zabbix-widget-event-timeline (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Stacked bar chart of problem events per time bucket by
    severity, for selected hosts / host groups.
  * Automatic bucket width (up to 100 buckets, calendar aligned in the user's
    time zone, weeks start on Monday).
  * Tooltip with per-severity event details (host-grouped or chronological),
    hover emphasis, X axis period lines, Y axis minimum scale, and line/text
    colors (Auto follows the Zabbix theme; custom via picker or hex input).
  * Japanese and English locale support.

 -- claude <noreply@example.com>  Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
